>> EOF
>> COPY acrolein.xyz .

&GATEWAY
  Coord=acrolein.xyz
  Basis=6-31G
  Group=NoSym
  Constraints
    a = EDiff
  Value
    a = 0.0
  End of constraints
  NoCD

>>> DoWhile

* State-averaging two roots onto a near-degenerate singlet/triplet crossing
* seam leaves the default RASSCF/ALASKA/SEWARD thresholds loose enough that
* two otherwise-identical runs pick slightly different points on the flat
* part of the seam at each step; the per-iteration geometries then diverge
* run-to-run, and by the later SEWARD calls the integral values miss the
* checkfile tolerance entirely. Tightening the three thresholds below keeps
* both runs on the same trajectory to within the checkfile tolerances.
  &SEWARD
    CutOff = 1.0D-20

  >>> If (ITER ne 1)
    >>> Copy Triplet.JobIph $Project.JobIph
  >>> EndIf
  &RASSCF
    File   = $Project.GssOrb
    Spin   = 3
    NActEl = 2
    RAS2   = 2
    Charge = 0
    THRS
      1.0e-10 1.0e-06 1.0e-06
  >>> Copy $Project.JobIph Triplet.JobIph
  &ALASKA
    CutOff = 1.0D-10

  >>> Copy $Project.RunFile $Project.RunFile2

  >>> If (ITER ne 1)
    >>> Copy Singlet.JobIph $Project.JobIph
  >>> EndIf
  &RASSCF
    File   = $Project.GssOrb
    Spin   = 1
    NActEl = 2
    RAS2   = 2
    Charge = 0
    CiRoot = 2 2 1
    RlxRoot = 1
    THRS
      1.0e-10 1.0e-06 1.0e-06
  >>> Copy $Project.JobIph Singlet.JobIph
  &ALASKA
    CutOff = 1.0D-10

  &SLAPAF

>>> EndDo

